<%
  const stepByField = {
    displayName: 0,
    archetype: 0,
    tagline: 0,
    purpose: 0,
    timezone: 1,
    presenceMode: 1,
    presenceLabel: 1,
    address: 1,
    summary: 1,
    contact: 1,
    presenceMaterial: 1,
    direction: 2,
    participation: 3,
    activityTitle: 3,
    activityDescription: 3,
    activityStartsLocal: 3,
    activityEndsLocal: 3,
  };
  const firstErrorField = errors.length ? String(errors[0].path || '') : '';
  const initialStep = Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(stepByField, firstErrorField) ? stepByField[firstErrorField] : 0;
  const activityOpen = Boolean(values.activityTitle || values.activityDescription || values.activityStartsLocal || values.activityEndsLocal)
    || errors.some((error) => String(error.path || '').startsWith('activity'));
%>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
  <title><%= pageTitle %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/candidate-c.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/candidate-c-accessibility.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/candidate-c-remediation.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/candidate-c-creator-convergence.css">
</head>
<body class="cc-creator-body">
  <div class="cc-creator-shell" data-creator data-initial-step="<%= initialStep %>">
    <aside class="cc-creator-guide" aria-label="Creation progress">
      <a class="cc-creator-guide__home" href="/candidate-c">
        <span class="cc-creator-guide__mark" aria-hidden="true">H</span>
        <span>HiVenues</span>
      </a>

      <div class="cc-creator-guide__intro">
        <p class="cc-creator-guide__eyebrow">Create your place</p>
        <h1>Start with the host, not a template.</h1>
        <p>Give HiVenues truthful material and a direction. You will see the first working version before anything can be live.</p>
      </div>

      <nav class="cc-creator-progress" aria-label="Creation steps">
        <button type="button" data-creator-progress data-available="true"><span>1</span><span>Purpose</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-creator-progress data-available="false"><span>2</span><span>Presence</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-creator-progress data-available="false"><span>3</span><span>Direction</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-creator-progress data-available="false"><span>4</span><span>Participation</span></button>
      </nav>
    </aside>

    <main class="cc-creator-main">
      <div class="cc-creator-main__inner">
        <div class="cc-creator-safety">
          This creates one private working host and its first website version. Nothing is sent to Hive, an external media provider, a payment service, DNS, or a deployment target.
        </div>

        <% if (errors.length) { %>
          <section class="cc-creator-errors" role="alert" aria-live="polite">
            <strong>Check these facts before HiVenues creates the first draft.</strong>
            <ul><% errors.forEach((error) => { %><li><%= error.message %></li><% }) %></ul>
            <% if (reason) { %><details><summary>Technical reference</summary><small><%= reason %></small></details><% } %>
          </section>
        <% } %>

        <form class="cc-creator-form" method="post" action="/candidate-c/new" novalidate>
          <fieldset class="cc-creator-stage" data-creator-stage data-active="<%= initialStep === 0 ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
            <div class="cc-creator-stage__head">
              <p class="cc-creator-kicker">1 · Purpose</p>
              <h2>What are you making a place for?</h2>
              <p>Start with identity and intent. These words are real host material, not setup metadata hidden from visitors.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="cc-creator-grid">
              <div class="cc-creator-field">
                <label for="cc-display-name">Host name</label>
                <input id="cc-display-name" name="displayName" maxlength="100" required value="<%= values.displayName %>" autocomplete="organization">
              </div>
              <div class="cc-creator-field">
                <label for="cc-archetype">What kind of host is this?</label>
                <input id="cc-archetype" name="archetype" maxlength="120" required value="<%= values.archetype %>" placeholder="Neighborhood venue, artist studio, publication…">
              </div>
              <div class="cc-creator-field cc-creator-field--wide">
                <label for="cc-tagline">First impression</label>
                <input id="cc-tagline" name="tagline" maxlength="180" required value="<%= values.tagline %>" placeholder="The line visitors should feel first">
              </div>
              <div class="cc-creator-field cc-creator-field--wide">
                <label for="cc-purpose">Why does this place exist?</label>
                <textarea id="cc-purpose" name="purpose" maxlength="800" required><%= values.purpose %></textarea>
                <small>Use truthful host language. You can reshape it later in the same Studio.</small>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="cc-creator-actions">
              <a class="cc-creator-button cc-creator-button--quiet" href="/candidate-c">Back</a>
              <div class="cc-creator-actions__right"><button class="cc-creator-button" type="button" data-creator-next>Show the next consequence</button></div>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="cc-creator-stage" data-creator-stage data-active="<%= initialStep === 1 ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
            <div class="cc-creator-stage__head">
              <p class="cc-creator-kicker">2 · Presence & material</p>
              <h2>What makes this place feel real?</h2>
              <p>Tell visitors where the host exists, how to reach it, and what atmosphere or material belongs to its world.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="cc-creator-grid">
              <div class="cc-creator-field cc-creator-field--wide">
                <label>How people reach this host</label>
                <div class="cc-creator-choice-row">
                  <% [['physical','Physical place','People can visit a real location.'],['online','Online','The host lives primarily online.'],['hybrid','Hybrid','A physical place with an online presence.']].forEach(([value,label,copy]) => { %>
                    <label class="cc-creator-choice">
                      <input type="radio" name="presenceMode" value="<%= value %>" <%= values.presenceMode === value ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                      <strong><%= label %></strong><span><%= copy %></span>
                    </label>
                  <% }) %>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="cc-creator-field">
                <label for="cc-presence-label">Public location / availability line</label>
                <input id="cc-presence-label" name="presenceLabel" maxlength="240" required value="<%= values.presenceLabel %>" placeholder="Downtown · evenings, or Locationless · live sessions">
              </div>
              <div class="cc-creator-field">
                <label for="cc-address">Physical address</label>
                <input id="cc-address" name="address" maxlength="300" <%= values.presenceMode === 'online' ? '' : 'required' %> value="<%= values.address %>">
                <small data-address-hint><%= values.presenceMode === 'online' ? 'Optional for an online-only host.' : 'Required for a physical or hybrid host.' %></small>
              </div>

              <div class="cc-creator-field">
                <label for="cc-contact">How visitors can reach you</label>
                <input id="cc-contact" name="contact" maxlength="240" required value="<%= values.contact %>" placeholder="Email, phone, or https:// website">
              </div>
              <div class="cc-creator-field">
                <label for="cc-timezone">Host local timezone</label>
                <input id="cc-timezone" name="timezone" maxlength="100" required value="<%= values.timezone %>" placeholder="America/Los_Angeles">
                <small>Used for truthful Activity times. This is not visitor copy.</small>
              </div>

              <div class="cc-creator-field cc-creator-field--wide">
                <label for="cc-summary">What should a visitor understand quickly?</label>
                <textarea id="cc-summary" name="summary" maxlength="1200" required><%= values.summary %></textarea>
              </div>
              <div class="cc-creator-field cc-creator-field--wide">
                <label for="cc-material">Atmosphere, material, or story</label>
                <textarea id="cc-material" name="presenceMaterial" maxlength="800" required><%= values.presenceMaterial %></textarea>
                <small>Describe the host itself, not CSS or art-direction instructions.</small>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="cc-creator-actions">
              <button class="cc-creator-button cc-creator-button--quiet" type="button" data-creator-back>Back</button>
              <div class="cc-creator-actions__right"><button class="cc-creator-button" type="button" data-creator-next>See directions</button></div>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="cc-creator-stage" data-creator-stage data-active="<%= initialStep === 2 ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
            <div class="cc-creator-stage__head">
              <p class="cc-creator-kicker">3 · Direction</p>
              <h2>Which world feels most like this host?</h2>
              <p>These are structural directions, not color themes. The same truthful material is composed with a different hierarchy, rhythm, navigation, media treatment, and mobile behavior.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="cc-direction-gallery">
              <label class="cc-direction-choice">
                <input type="radio" name="direction" value="poster" required <%= values.direction === 'poster' ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                <span class="cc-direction-choice__frame">
                  <span class="cc-direction-mini cc-direction-mini--poster">
                    <span class="cc-direction-mini__rail"><span data-preview-name><%= values.displayName || 'Your place' %></span><span>NOW</span></span>
                    <span class="cc-direction-mini__content">
                      <span class="cc-direction-mini__type" data-preview-type><%= values.archetype || 'your kind of host' %></span>
                      <strong class="cc-direction-mini__tagline" data-preview-tagline><%= values.tagline || 'A first impression that belongs to you.' %></strong>
                      <span class="cc-direction-mini__block" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="cc-direction-choice__caption"><strong>Poster room</strong><span>Bold, event-led, tactile and immediate.</span></span>
                </span>
              </label>

              <label class="cc-direction-choice">
                <input type="radio" name="direction" value="editorial" <%= values.direction === 'editorial' ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                <span class="cc-direction-choice__frame">
                  <span class="cc-direction-mini cc-direction-mini--editorial">
                    <span class="cc-direction-mini__masthead"><span data-preview-name><%= values.displayName || 'Your place' %></span><span>01</span></span>
                    <span class="cc-direction-mini__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="cc-direction-mini__spread">
                      <span><span class="cc-direction-mini__type" data-preview-type><%= values.archetype || 'your kind of host' %></span><strong class="cc-direction-mini__tagline" data-preview-tagline><%= values.tagline || 'A first impression that belongs to you.' %></strong></span>
                      <span class="cc-direction-mini__media" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="cc-direction-choice__caption"><strong>Editorial field notes</strong><span>Publication-like, open, narrative and composed.</span></span>
                </span>
              </label>

              <label class="cc-direction-choice">
                <input type="radio" name="direction" value="hospitality" <%= values.direction === 'hospitality' ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                <span class="cc-direction-choice__frame">
                  <span class="cc-direction-mini cc-direction-mini--hospitality">
                    <span class="cc-direction-mini__masthead"><span data-preview-name><%= values.displayName || 'Your place' %></span><span>VISIT</span></span>
                    <span class="cc-direction-mini__arrival"><span class="cc-direction-mini__media" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong class="cc-direction-mini__tagline" data-preview-tagline><%= values.tagline || 'A first impression that belongs to you.' %></strong></span>
                    <span class="cc-direction-mini__menu" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="cc-direction-choice__caption"><strong>Hospitality table</strong><span>Warm, media-led, service-aware and inviting.</span></span>
                </span>
              </label>
            </div>

            <div class="cc-creator-actions">
              <button class="cc-creator-button cc-creator-button--quiet" type="button" data-creator-back>Back</button>
              <div class="cc-creator-actions__right"><button class="cc-creator-button" type="button" data-creator-next>Shape participation</button></div>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="cc-creator-stage" data-creator-stage data-active="<%= initialStep === 3 ? 'true' : 'false' %>">
            <div class="cc-creator-stage__head">
              <p class="cc-creator-kicker">4 · Participation</p>
              <h2>What can people meaningfully do here?</h2>
              <p>Describe the invitation in the host's own language. Add a first Activity only when you already have real facts for it.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="cc-creator-grid">
              <div class="cc-creator-field cc-creator-field--wide">
                <label for="cc-participation">Visitor invitation</label>
                <textarea id="cc-participation" name="participation" maxlength="800" required><%= values.participation %></textarea>
                <small>This becomes public host language. Underlying consequences remain exact when an action reaches a real capability boundary.</small>
              </div>
            </div>

            <details class="cc-creator-optional" <%= activityOpen ? 'open' : '' %>>
              <summary>Optional · Add a first Activity with real facts</summary>
              <div class="cc-creator-optional__body">
                <p class="cc-creator-final-note">Complete all four Activity fields together, or leave all four blank. HiVenues will not invent an event to make the page look fuller.</p>
                <div class="cc-creator-grid">
                  <div class="cc-creator-field cc-creator-field--wide"><label for="cc-activity-title">Activity title</label><input id="cc-activity-title" name="activityTitle" maxlength="120" value="<%= values.activityTitle %>"></div>
                  <div class="cc-creator-field cc-creator-field--wide"><label for="cc-activity-description">Activity description</label><textarea id="cc-activity-description" name="activityDescription" maxlength="1200"><%= values.activityDescription %></textarea></div>
                  <div class="cc-creator-field"><label for="cc-activity-start">Starts</label><input id="cc-activity-start" type="datetime-local" name="activityStartsLocal" value="<%= values.activityStartsLocal %>"></div>
                  <div class="cc-creator-field"><label for="cc-activity-end">Ends</label><input id="cc-activity-end" type="datetime-local" name="activityEndsLocal" value="<%= values.activityEndsLocal %>"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </details>

            <p class="cc-creator-final-note">Next, HiVenues creates one working host and reveals its first draft. Nothing is live. The same host then opens directly in Studio, where Purpose, Direction, Look, Voice, material and participation remain revisitable.</p>

            <div class="cc-creator-actions">
              <button class="cc-creator-button cc-creator-button--quiet" type="button" data-creator-back>Back</button>
              <div class="cc-creator-actions__right"><button class="cc-creator-button" type="submit">Create my first draft</button></div>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
        </form>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/candidate-c-creator.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
